sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor UserA as Active User (Client A)
    participant UI as React 19 UI (@dnd-kit)
    participant Cache as TanStack Query Cache
    participant API as NestJS API Gateway
    participant Guard as FSM & RBAC Guards
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 15
    participant Redis as Redis 7 Pub/Sub
    participant Gateway as Socket.IO EventsGateway
    actor UserB as Teammate (Client B)

    Note over UserA, Cache: 1. Drag Initiation & Optimistic UI
    UserA->>UI: Drags ticket CORE-101 to Sprint 2 / In Progress
    UI->>UI: PointerSensor activates (3px threshold)
    UI->>Cache: setQueriesData (Synchronous Optimistic Update)
    UI-->>UserA: UI updates immediately (Zero perceived latency)

    Note over UI, DB: 2. Network Mutation & Backend Validation
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/issues/101/sprint (sprintId: 2)
    API->>Guard: Validate user permission ("EDIT_ISSUES")
    API->>Guard: Validate FSM workflow transition
    Guard-->>API: Validated (OK)
    API->>DB: UPDATE issues SET sprint_id = 2 WHERE id = 101
    DB-->>API: 1 row affected
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Updated Issue DTO)

    Note over API, UserB: 3. Real-Time Broadcast & Teammate Sync
    API->>Gateway: emitIssueUpdated(project: CORE, issue)
    Gateway->>Redis: PUBLISH project:CORE:events
    Redis-->>Gateway: Broadcast to cluster nodes
    Gateway-->>UserB: WebSocket Event ("issue:updated", issue)
    UserB->>Cache: setQueryData (Update Issue in Teammate Cache)
    UserB-->>UserB: Teammate board updates in real time
